"text":"Shared with Dropbox","thumb_url":"https://www.dropbox.com/static/images/spectrum-icons/generated/content/content-folder_dropbox-large.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Dropbox","thumb_width":160,"thumb_height":160,"from_url":"https://www.dropbox.com/sh/arnpe0ef5wds8cv/AAAk_SECQ2Nc6SVGii3rHX6Fa?dl=0","original_url":"https://www.dropbox.com/sh/arnpe0ef5wds8cv/AAAk_SECQ2Nc6SVGii3rHX6Fa?dl=0"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UJ70JTGR3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZaPe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4de87263-5415-44cd-a9d3-755d7ee1cdcd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"アルゴ式は練習しかないからか、input 全部見せてくれた","ts":"1635004897.031500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JIG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"531b7daf-4061-47a2-a4f1-cd90ba2c3792","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"と言うか過去問とかの練習のための問題については WA 出たら input 見せて欲しいとずっと思っているんだけどなんでやらないんだろう。本番のコンテストでやらないのはわかるんだけど","ts":"1635004875.031200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bWSX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c7e5c90-86cb-46cd-b35c-07afe489501e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"競プロでも終わった過去のコンテストについては別にインセンティブないしなぁ","ts":"1635004815.030100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uF="}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5512a4f-1ec1-4cc6-a638-304c22e9ccd1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ズルにインセンティブが見出せる競プロでは絶対に取れない方式","ts":"1635004782.029600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9+z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02bc4ec5-8b8c-4438-8b5c-177d8e810a05","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちゃんとやるなら言語ごとに TLE 設定すると良いとは思うんだけど、じゃあこの言語の適切な TLE はいくつなんだ、ってのが決められないんでしょうねぇ","ts":"1635004776.029300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P8S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18cfa1f4-1689-455f-99cf-c76bef573250","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":sumanu-taimingu-warukattakamo-desu:","ts":"1635004735.028100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Wd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f80faeb3-8e47-4dde-bd38-100176bbb236","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今同じの貼ろうとしていた。Project Euler は Vim でも参戦できて便利 (なお問題自体が難しくて途中で挫折した模様)","ts":"1635004725.027900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BnO6Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dc8d67d-3fda-411c-b355-39d218964537","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どんなプログラミング言語でも挑戦できるけど、まあこれはズルにインセンティブが無いので成り立っているんですよね…","ts":"1635004707.027500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RVt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"436588b9-c08a-45f8-8cea-b0d84a52f2f9","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"一番遅い言語に合わせると C++ で想定じゃない計算量のものも通っちゃったりするので、AtCoder みたいに一律の時間制限だと難しいと思います。","ts":"1635004687.026600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y2rA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9dd709a3-0991-4e9c-b4d1-4986e5304f96","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Project Eulerっていう問題集があるんですが、これは解答を提出するだけなんですよね\n\u003chttps://projecteuler.net\u003e","ts":"1635004681.026300","attachments":[{"fallback":"About - Project Euler","id":1,"title":"About - Project Euler","title_link":"https://projecteuler.net/","text":"A website dedicated to the fascinating world of mathematics and programming","blocks":null,"service_name":"projecteuler.net","service_icon":"https://projecteuler.net/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://projecteuler.net/","original_url":"https://projecteuler.net"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hZMc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5540e81a-7a4c-4f58-9786-1b1ae0128b2c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"登場直後は Lua より速いとか言ってた気がするけど、あの段階ではバグも全然取れていなくて必要な機能も入りきってなかったと思うから今はそれなりに遅くなっているんじゃないかと言う気がしている (測ってないので実際のところはわからないw 完全に想像で発言している)","ts":"1635004595.024500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"74P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8d413d2-ae5c-4769-84c0-c9b98a614f23","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"どうせ間違ったアルゴリズム使ったら年単位で時間かかるんだから TLE もう少しゆるくてもいいのにって気はしているけど、あんまり長い時間許可するとマシンリソース足りなくなるとかなのかな","ts":"1635004499.023100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rmKI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afd1f015-eb37-49bc-a024-c5956f68f0e2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"バイトコードインタプリタならそのへんの速度でしょみたいな雑な感覚","ts":"1635004468.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x7Vy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29ce3aa7-4379-4358-8683-676a3e4bfcf5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Pythonと同等くらいだと思ってる、測ったことないので知らんけど","ts":"1635004454.022000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z7qT2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7ece214-e84f-4920-8b61-d35707fb5d68","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"Ruby や Python で TLE はたまにあるくらいですね。上の方に行かないとあまり出会えないくらい。","ts":"1635004453.021900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1yTkY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25ae223c-eef9-4853-ae08-21320e4a65ee","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim9 script は速いらしいです。けど AtCoder ではまだ使えなさそう (まあ速いと言ってもそこまででもないとは思いますが)","ts":"1635004434.021500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"afq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"690a772f-3142-47fd-90f6-44ae10496641","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"問題によっては Ruby とかでも TLE するって聞くし、Python もキビしいって話がついさっき上がってたし、こうなるとごく一部の超高速な言語以外ではやるなって言ってるのと同じだと思うんですよねぇ","ts":"1635004384.020000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GjZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c79c419-3478-4258-97e7-0f277d4ca395","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"まずは Vim 言語の速い処理系を作るところからですね。","ts":"1635004378.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wGG/7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ecb8c34-18b5-468e-9e1e-a746b4ca475e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なので、もうやらなくていいかなの気持ちです。好きな言語でできないとモチベが上がらない","ts":"1635004156.017900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YjmEE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d83fbbcf-42c9-4919-832d-8526c7443b66","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"Vim 言語だとさすがに厳しいと思う。","ts":"1635003985.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8ZMC="}]},{"client_msg_id":"820c8412-af46-459c-a78c-b41c16cdc4ff","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"久々に競プロの練習したけど、DP の理解が少し進んで収穫があったし、やっぱり好きな言語を使って解くことはできないことを痛感したのでまたしばらくはいいかな…の構えになった","ts":"1635003083.016800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aamfe"}]}]
